<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4085529492781968087..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Your &quot;Duty&quot; to Protect and Serve the Police </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>15</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1348332823694886559</id><published>2015-09-10T07:43:59.684-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-10T07:43:59.684-06:00</updated><title type='text'>To Mario Kenny,&#xa;&#xa;Yeah, the entire concept of &amp;quot...</title><content type='html'>To Mario Kenny,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yeah, the entire concept of &amp;quot;rhetorical violence&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;verbal violence&amp;quot; is ridiculous.  When did we become such victims that someone saying they think you&amp;#39;re wrong constitutes violence?  To make it worse, these claims to victimization are coming from the most violent caste of Americans.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/1348332823694886559'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/1348332823694886559'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441892639684#c1348332823694886559' title=''/><author><name>All Wrong</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01313858228631416622</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-930702987"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 10, 2015 at 7:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2380840119033831385</id><published>2015-09-08T18:19:55.840-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-08T18:19:55.840-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This means shielding police not only from violence...</title><content type='html'>This means shielding police not only from violence directed against them, and the legal consequences of violence used by them, but also from the “rhetorical violence” supposedly committed by people who scrutinize their conduct and condemn their abuses.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So this means no one can be critical of police</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/2380840119033831385'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/2380840119033831385'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441757995840#c2380840119033831385' title=''/><author><name>Mario Kenny</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10951904468765419392</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7Q00rU0qs30/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAlQ/A5r8A_tkod8/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1196521400"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 8, 2015 at 6:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7563729346479819611</id><published>2015-09-05T21:41:05.029-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-05T21:41:05.029-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Grigg,&#xa;If you haven&amp;#39;t already, check out t...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Grigg,&lt;br /&gt;If you haven&amp;#39;t already, check out the comments http://www.policeone.com/patrol-issues/articles/9485292-Arbys-workers-disciplined-after-refusing-to-serve-Fla-officer&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Cops complaining about sole being suspended with pay. They truly live in a bubble to not see the irony.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7563729346479819611'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7563729346479819611'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441510865029#c7563729346479819611' title=''/><author><name>joyce</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-670098679"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 5, 2015 at 9:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-499808846691660770</id><published>2015-09-04T14:01:39.746-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-04T14:01:39.746-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, have you seen this:&#xa;&#xa;http://countercurrentne...</title><content type='html'>Will, have you seen this:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://countercurrentnews.com/2015/09/texas-sheriff-says-you-have-to-obey-the-police-because-their-authority-comes-from-god/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I am speechless, I knew they all have over - inflated egos, but this is truly over the top.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/499808846691660770'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/499808846691660770'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441396899746#c499808846691660770' title=''/><author><name>Bill in IL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1793685183"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2015 at 2:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7799329778541509034</id><published>2015-09-04T10:27:37.762-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-04T10:27:37.762-06:00</updated><title type='text'>So if a citizen, ordered to help by a government e...</title><content type='html'>So if a citizen, ordered to help by a government employee, &amp;quot;accidentally&amp;quot;  plants a steel toed boot to the government employee&amp;#39;s temple, that will be excused the same way a government employee who &amp;quot;accidentally&amp;quot;  commits battery on a citizen would be, correct? We can&amp;#39;t expect all blows to land correctly in the &amp;quot;heat of battle&amp;quot;, right?  We can&amp;#39;t be &amp;quot;Monday morning quarterbacking&amp;quot; when a citizen fears for his life when ordered to help a government employee.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Or if the citizen under those same orders picks up the government employee&amp;#39;s weapon and fires all 15 rounds randomly in the general direction of the altercation, he will be able to say &amp;quot;I was in fear for my life.&amp;quot; correct?  That seems to be SOP for most police agencies.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Or maybe the citizen dowses both combatants with a debilitating  chemical agent, that would be approved, right?  After all, cops routinely spray large crowds with tear gas, coating the innocent along with the &amp;quot;guilty&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7799329778541509034'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7799329778541509034'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441384057762#c7799329778541509034' title=''/><author><name>Chris Mallory</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13001920155309388738</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-nW0sYVoK7u8/VY0v2yuPepI/AAAAAAAAAag/1VECKkDk5ec/s220/Orphan_Brigade.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1685275614"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2015 at 10:27 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1248263623130100539</id><published>2015-09-03T20:56:09.173-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T20:56:09.173-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Under the Alabama statute, who will bear responsib...</title><content type='html'>Under the Alabama statute, who will bear responsibility if a citizen attempts to offer aid, and an officer misinterprets the move, thinks he&amp;#39;s being engaged by an additional perp, and the officer inflicts grave to fatal injury on the good Samaritan?  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/1248263623130100539'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/1248263623130100539'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441335369173#c1248263623130100539' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1021213283"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 8:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-876824897211336598</id><published>2015-09-03T16:11:26.262-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T16:11:26.262-06:00</updated><title type='text'>donna from North Dakota:&#xa;&#xa;Still have NOT heard fro...</title><content type='html'>donna from North Dakota:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Still have NOT heard from my state representatives regarding arming drones with &amp;#39;nonlethal&amp;#39; weapons.  According to the bill&amp;#39;s author, Representative Rick Becker, House Bill 1328 was amended with the weapons provision to insure his &amp;#39;primary intent requiring law enforcement to obtain a search warrant prior to being able to conduct surveillance on private citizens&amp;#39; was legally established.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well...I&amp;#39;m not sure why we have had 24/7 drone surveillance over our farm...at least since I first noticed them in 2002.  We aren&amp;#39;t on any USDA Programs requiring compliance.  In fact, we don&amp;#39;t do much of anything but graze a few sheep &amp;amp; goats, horses, &amp;amp; run a tiny flock of chickens.  These are the LARGE drones, too!  They have running lights, seemingly perpetual operating systems, and are extremely nimble in their abilities to move in for a closer &amp;#39;look&amp;#39; when someone goes out to check animals after dark or &amp;#39;take a leak&amp;#39;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well, anyway, maybe ordinary folk need to carry around their own armed-drone emergency packs to be deployed ONLY when officers finding themselves in overwhelming difficulties are in need of assistance.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/876824897211336598'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/876824897211336598'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441318286262#c876824897211336598' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1126745188"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 4:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3469132811493125704</id><published>2015-09-03T12:06:54.256-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T12:06:54.256-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;A person commits the crime of refusing to ai...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;A person commits the crime of refusing to aid a peace officer if, upon command by a peace officer identified to him as such, he fails or refuses to aid.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ARE there any peace officers working for the police any more?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/3469132811493125704'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/3469132811493125704'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441303614256#c3469132811493125704' title=''/><author><name>Bill St. Clair</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18239727850851239731</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2016843451"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 12:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8512495720772193413</id><published>2015-09-03T08:09:53.135-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T08:09:53.135-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;I was going to add that even if Dan Grayson...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I was going to add that even if Dan Grayson&amp;#39;s view was correct, most of your readers understand that any prosecutor will present the case to any jury as though the standers-by &lt;i&gt;should&lt;/i&gt; have rendered aid.  And, unfortunately, most juries these days will buy the prosecutors view of the law and convict the individual in question.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/8512495720772193413'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/8512495720772193413'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441289393135#c8512495720772193413' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-76125855"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 8:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7585785437889638354</id><published>2015-09-03T06:39:17.020-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T06:39:17.020-06:00</updated><title type='text'>With reference to Mr. Grayson&amp;#39;s point, this is...</title><content type='html'>With reference to Mr. Grayson&amp;#39;s point, this is the specific portion of the statute under discussion:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;A person is not liable under this section if the failure or refusal to aid the officer was reasonable under the circumstances. &lt;i&gt;The burden of injecting this issue is on the defendant but this does not shift the burden of proof.&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; (Emphasis added.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This formula doesn&amp;#39;t require that a defendant prove his innocence, but it does assume that a &amp;quot;refusal to aid&amp;quot; an officer is unreasonable, and places on the accused the &amp;quot;burden&amp;quot; of overcoming that presumption. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7585785437889638354'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7585785437889638354'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441283957020#c7585785437889638354' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-zmaGZphu-5g/VSHB9joqC0I/AAAAAAAALhQ/5GhsHssjwLc/s220/April%2B5%2B2015%2Bprofile%2Bpic.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 6:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8160542876261132184</id><published>2015-09-03T05:57:23.638-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T05:57:23.638-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Re: &amp;quot;Under Alabama&amp;#39;s statute, onlookers a...</title><content type='html'>Re: &amp;quot;Under Alabama&amp;#39;s statute, onlookers are not liable to prosecution if the failure to render aid “was reasonable under the circumstances,” but the burden of demonstrating that this is the case is placed upon the accused. &amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You misread the statute, which says that burden of proof is not altered.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/8160542876261132184'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/8160542876261132184'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441281443638#c8160542876261132184' title=''/><author><name>Daniel R. Grayson</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01196301306869823595</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='27' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_RTom9h0WjqQ/SZiWEwbqFxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/_nXaOP-5oy4/S220/grayson2005.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1028814292"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 5:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6719231279056331761</id><published>2015-09-03T05:46:20.168-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T05:46:20.168-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;ve got to know, Will.  How do you do it?  Ho...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;ve got to know, Will.  How do you do it?  How do you not just give up in impotent frustration?  You do far more than I do, yet we fall farther and farther behind the State every day.  How do you keep from slipping into apathy over it all?  I&amp;#39;m serious when I ask this, because I find myself getting more and more apathetic by the day.  People will nod along and agree with me wholeheartedly, then turn around and continue to support the status quo.  To quote Joss Whedon&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;Dr. Horrible&amp;#39;s Sing-Along Blog&amp;quot; (which I highly recommend you spend the 45 minutes to watch, because it&amp;#39;s extremely entertaining) &amp;quot;Well, the status is NOT...quo.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyway, to the point of this particular blog.  If I found myself in court trying to justify why I didn&amp;#39;t help a cop, I&amp;#39;m sure I&amp;#39;d go to jail.  I can easily see myself in court stating, &amp;quot;If a cop was on fire, I wouldn&amp;#39;t piss on him to put him out.&amp;quot;  He&amp;#39;s &lt;i&gt;paid&lt;/i&gt; to be a &amp;quot;public servant&amp;quot; that supposedly &amp;quot;protects and serves&amp;quot; yet we know he isn&amp;#39;t a servant of the public and he doesn&amp;#39;t protect or serve anything but those in power.  If they want me to put myself in danger to assist a cop, I demand they pay me, and clothe me in qualified immunity, as well.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/6719231279056331761'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/6719231279056331761'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441280780168#c6719231279056331761' title=''/><author><name>All Wrong</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01313858228631416622</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-930702987"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 5:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7234001897929526031</id><published>2015-09-03T01:07:49.687-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-03T01:07:49.687-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous @ 9:50 PM,&#xa;&#xa;Pray all you want for the ba...</title><content type='html'>&lt;br /&gt;Anonymous @ 9:50 PM,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pray all you want for the badged thugs.  You still have that bit of freedom.  But you better understand that those with badges and guns, are ONLY there to protect your fellow elite citizens you love so much.  You know them as &amp;quot;government&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is no reason why we need government agents with badges and guns.  They protect no common citizen.  There are no good cops.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7234001897929526031'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/7234001897929526031'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441264069687#c7234001897929526031' title=''/><author><name>Bubba</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1980323166"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 3, 2015 at 1:07 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6371834236784028749</id><published>2015-09-02T21:50:06.783-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-02T21:50:06.783-06:00</updated><title type='text'>No one is being forced to pray for the safety of f...</title><content type='html'>No one is being forced to pray for the safety of fellow human beings. &lt;br /&gt;If the thought of doing so is distasteful to the author then, I would suggest, they need someone to pray for them as well and there are PPL out there willing to do so </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/6371834236784028749'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/6371834236784028749'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441252206783#c6371834236784028749' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1566049321"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2015 at 9:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6875356051559148946</id><published>2015-09-02T17:10:03.491-06:00</published><updated>2015-09-02T17:10:03.491-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If government security provisioners do  not want t...</title><content type='html'>If government security provisioners do  not want to listen to criticism then they  need only allow competition.   Let   people express their concerns with security providers not in words but  in  subscriptions.  Restore to Americans the fundamental right of consumer choice.  Restore to Americans the freedom to choose the security providers they feel are the best in a free market in  competing free enterprise security service providers.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/6875356051559148946'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4085529492781968087/comments/default/6875356051559148946'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html?showComment=1441235403491#c6875356051559148946' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/09/your-duty-to-protect-and-serve-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4085529492781968087' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4085529492781968087' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-291411207"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2015 at 5:10 PM"/></entry></feed>